ượt mà nhu cầu chơi game eSports, làm việc văn phòng, hay giải trí đa phương tiện hằng ngày.</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; line-height: 1.38;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; line-height: 1.38;"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GFsVxxaWc50" width="700" height="350" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: initial; display: block; font-family: inherit !important;"></iframe></p><h3 style="margin: 16pt 0px 4pt; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 14pt;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">PC Gaming - Glacier i3050 - Nền tảng ổn định, dễ nâng cấp</span></strong></span></h3><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Bộ PC sử dụng bo mạch chủ </span><a href="https://www.tncstore.vn/bo-mach-chu-asus-prime-h610m-k-d4.html" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(41, 50, 78); font-family: inherit !important;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 153, 0); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">ASUS PRIME H610M-K D4</span></strong></a><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">, dòng main phổ biến dành cho CPU Intel Gen 12/13. Thiết kế nhỏ gọn, bền bỉ cùng khả năng hỗ trợ RAM DDR4 giúp tối ưu chi phí mà vẫn đảm bảo hiệu năng. Ngoài ra, bo mạch còn có đầy đủ cổng M.2 và USB tốc độ cao, tạo nền tảng vững chắc để người dùng nâng cấp linh hoạt trong tương lai.</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; line-height: 1.38;"><img src="https://www.tncstore.vn/media/lib/12-11-2025/pc-gaming-glacier-i3050-4.jpg" alt="TNC Store PC Gaming - Glacier i3050" width="700" height="394" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"></p><h3 style="margin: 16pt 0px 4pt; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 14pt;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inh