 Arial, sans-serif; list-style: inside disc; white-space: pre; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;">Bảo hành 36 Tháng (1 Đổi 1)</span></li><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; list-style: inside disc; white-space: pre; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;">Đội ngũ làm việc chuyên nghiệp và tận tâm</span></li></ul>', '<ul class="content" id="show_summary" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">CPU:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.tncstore.vn/cpu-intel-core-i3-10105f-4c8t.html" target="_blank" rel="dofollow" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-de