 style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Trải Nghiệm Gõ Cao Cấp</span></strong></span></h3><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 14pt;"><a href="https://www.tncstore.vn/gaming-gear.html" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(41, 50, 78); font-family: inherit !important;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 153, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Gaming Gear</span></strong></a><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> này sử dụng switch ROG NX V2 Mechanical Storm (Linear - 40gf) cho lực nhấn nhẹ, hành trình mượt, rất phù hợp cho cả gõ văn bản lẫn gaming tốc độ cao.</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><img src="https://www.tncstore.vn/media/lib/14-08-2025/ban-phim-co-asus-rog-azoth-x-storm-v2-switch.jpg" alt="TNC Store Bàn Phím Cơ Asus M704 Rog Azoth X" width="700" height="350" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Kết cấu Gasket Mount kết hợp tấm FR4 giúp giảm rung, mang lại cảm giác gõ êm ái và âm thanh trầm ấm. Đèn nền RGB per-key lung linh, đồng bộ qua Armoury Crate, cho phép bạn tùy biến phong cách theo ý muốn.</span></p><h3 style="margin: 16pt 0px 4pt; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 14pt;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Kết Nối Đa Dạng</span></strong></span></h3><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Asus M704 ROG Azoth X hỗ trợ 3 chế độ kết nối:</span></p><ul style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding-inline-start: 48px;"><li style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; list-style: inside disc; white-space: pre; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;">Bluetooth 5.1 cho sự tiện lợi.</span></li><li style="margin: