 font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Ngoài ra, bàn phím còn được trang bị màn hình OLED hiển thị trạng thái kết nối, pin, chế độ… cùng knob điều khiển giúp thao tác nhanh chóng.</span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><img src="https://www.tncstore.vn/media/lib/14-08-2025/ban-phim-co-asus-rog-azoth-x-storm-v2-switch-2.jpg" alt="TNC Store Bàn Phím Cơ Asus M704 Rog Azoth X" width="700" height="350" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"></span></p><h2 style="margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 14pt;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-s