ant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> chính là địa chỉ mà bạn có thể yên tâm lựa chọn.</span></strong></span></p>', '<ul class="content" id="show_summary" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; list-style: none; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Loại bàn phím: Bàn phím cơ không dây</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Layout bàn phím: 75%</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Chuẩn kết nối: Bluetooth 5.1, Wired USB-C, Wireless 2.4GHz</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Chất liệu bàn phím: Khung phím: Nhôm CNC</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Phần mềm: Armoury Crate</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Hệ điều hành hỗ trợ: Windows 11, MacOS 10.11 trở lên</p></li></ul>', 10, 2, 3);
