ng bài viết dưới đây, hãy cùng TNC Store khám phá chi tiết bên trong sản phẩm có gì nhé!</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/h23Z__6R-VI" width="700" height="350" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: initial; display: block; font-family: inherit !important;"></iframe></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;">&nbsp;</p><h3 style="margin: 16pt 0px 4pt; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 14pt;"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Kích Thước Siêu Rộng Tối Ưu Không Gian</span></strong></span></h3><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-siz