/p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Công nghệ tấm nền: Rapid IPS</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Phân giải điểm ảnh: 2560 x 1440 (WQHD)</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Tần số quét màn: 240HZ</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Thời gian đáp ứng: 0.5ms (GtG, Min)</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Chỉ số màu sắc: 1.07B, 10 bits (8 bits + FRC)</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Hỗ trợ tiêu chuẩn: Vesa 100 x 100 mm, Anti-glare</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Cổng cắm kết nối: 2x HDMI™ 2.0b (WQHD@144Hz), 1x DisplayPort 1.4a (HBR3), 1x Headphone-out</p></li><li class="item" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: outside; line-height: 22px;"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 23px;">Phụ kiện trong hộp: Dây nguồn, dây DisplayPort</p></li></ul>', 10, 2014, 4);
