 0px; border-style: initial; font-family: inherit !important;"></iframe><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important;"></span></span></p><h3 dir="ltr" style="margin: 16pt 0px 4pt; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(67, 67, 67); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: inherit !important;">CPU Intel Core i7 13700K - Sự lựa chọn tối ưu cho PC AI Fusion I4070Ti BL 02</span></h3><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://www.tncstore.vn/cpu-intel-core-i7-13700k-hangnk.html" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(41, 50, 78); font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 153, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">CPU Intel Core I7 13700K</span></a><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> "Raptor Lake" là một trong ba mẫu </span><a href="https://www.tncstore.vn/cpu.html" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(41, 50, 78); font-family: inherit !important;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 153, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;">vi xử lý</span></a><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit !important; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;"> mà Intel ra mắt trong tháng này. Dòng vi xử lý máy tính để bàn "Raptor Lake" thế hệ thứ 13 có ý nghĩa quan trọng vì đây là dòng vi xử lý cuối cùng của Intel sử dụng silicon nguyên khối, vì công ty có kế hoạch xoay trục sang chiplets bằng chiến lược sản xuất IDM 2.0, với Meteor Lake và hơn thế nữa.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin: 0pt 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Chakra Petch&quot;; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.38;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;"><spa